@startuml F1.2-D03-senha-temporaria
title F1.2-D03 — 422 senha igual à temporária
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FirstAccessController" as Ctrl
participant "FirstAccessUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: senha temporária / Continuar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /auth/first-access
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario
Postgres --> UC: usuario

UC -> UC: Argon2id.verify = MATCH\n(RN-F1.2-05)

UC --> Ctrl: SenhaReutilizadaException\n(ROLLBACK)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422 Problem Details
WebApp --> Aluno: erro\npermanece em /primeiro-acesso

@enduml
